Keyboard Twister
================
http://picobay.com/dtv_wiki/index.php?title=Keyboard_Twister

Keyboard twister is an ATtiny45-based hardware solution to fix some issues in the DTV's keyboard emulation as well 
as mapping german keyboard layout.

Intel hex file see default/ directory.

Programming an ATtiny45 with AVRDUDE on Linux with an STK200 programmer:
avrdude -p t45 -c stk200 -P /dev/parport0 -U flash:w:keyboardtwister.hex:i -U lfuse:w:0xE2:m
